# Judder baseline — cut-v5d (editor release `cut-v5d`, `film.mp4` at editor f2b9a87) — qc#8

Method: `tools/judder.py` (see `tools/README.md`), run on the released `film.mp4` with the EDL `edit/cut-v5d/edl.json`.
Per-frame series: `frames.csv`; per-segment table: `segments.md`. Observed = measured on the decoded 1280×720 luma,
subtitle band excluded. Timecodes are m:ss.ff (frame/24).

